{
  "slug": "babel-fish",
  "name": "Babel Fish",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Auto-generates a 19-section project map, vocabulary translation layer, and developer skill for any codebase. Introspects routes, models, services, features, infrastructure, and session history to give Claude instant full-stack context. Maps plain-English phrases to exact file paths. Self-updates via pre-commit hook. Iterative install with 90% quality threshold and human-readable grading reports. Supports Python (FastAPI, Django, Flask), TypeScript/JavaScript (Next.js, NestJS, Express), Go, Java, and any stack using docker-compose, Terraform, or Prisma.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `babel-fish-developer-skill` (Full-stack developer context for babel-fish (unknown/unknown))\n- **Commands** (4): `policy` (Get or set the babel-fish update policy (auto | nudge | off)), `relink` (Re-run the skill linker — refresh symlinks from node_modules into .claude/skills/), `status` (Show installed version, latest available version, current update policy, and hook registration state), `update` (Update babel-fish to the latest version (runs npm update + re-links skills))\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install babel-fish@claude-community` from `TheGlitchKing/babel-fish`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
